$( <MM> <PROOF_ASST> THEOREM=dchrcondcl  LOC_AFTER=?

* The conductor is a positive integer dividing the level, and X is induced from a character mod the conductor (Mathlib conductor_ne_zero, conductor_dvd_level, factorsThrough_conductor).

s1::dchrcondcs |- ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) -> ( N DChrCond X ) e. { d e. NN | ( d || N /\ E. y e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` d ) ) X = ( ( d DChrInd N ) ` y ) ) } )
s2::dchrcondel |- ( ( N DChrCond X ) e. { d e. NN | ( d || N /\ E. y e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` d ) ) X = ( ( d DChrInd N ) ` y ) ) } <-> ( ( N DChrCond X ) e. NN /\ ( ( N DChrCond X ) || N /\ E. y e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` ( N DChrCond X ) ) ) X = ( ( ( N DChrCond X ) DChrInd N ) ` y ) ) ) )
s3:s1,s2:sylib |- ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) -> ( ( N DChrCond X ) e. NN /\ ( ( N DChrCond X ) || N /\ E. y e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` ( N DChrCond X ) ) ) X = ( ( ( N DChrCond X ) DChrInd N ) ` y ) ) ) )
s4::3anass |- ( ( ( N DChrCond X ) e. NN /\ ( N DChrCond X ) || N /\ E. y e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` ( N DChrCond X ) ) ) X = ( ( ( N DChrCond X ) DChrInd N ) ` y ) ) <-> ( ( N DChrCond X ) e. NN /\ ( ( N DChrCond X ) || N /\ E. y e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` ( N DChrCond X ) ) ) X = ( ( ( N DChrCond X ) DChrInd N ) ` y ) ) ) )
qed:s3,s4:sylibr |- ( ( N e. NN /\ X e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` N ) ) ) -> ( ( N DChrCond X ) e. NN /\ ( N DChrCond X ) || N /\ E. y e. ( Base ` ( DChr ` ( N DChrCond X ) ) ) X = ( ( ( N DChrCond X ) DChrInd N ) ` y ) ) )
$)
